  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He steps forward when Zhou Li hesitates and names himself as a Gu Immortal of Eastern Sea’s Tang clan. He offers Fang Yuan a way to prove innocence if Fang Yuan follows his terms. Tang clan is a super force in Eastern Sea, treated as equal to Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects.",
      "chapters": [
        1046
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_li",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_tang_clan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A cold expression and sharp gaze mark him as he first confronts Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1046
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cold-demeanor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan attacks him with flying sword Immortal Gu. Tang Song is caught off guard and falls at a disadvantage. He is a sound path Gu Immortal with insufficient defensive methods, so he can only evade the flying sword. After more than ten rounds he still trails and breaks out in cold sweat. He prepares an immortal killer move of four hundred and ninety Gu worms to capture Fang Yuan alive.",
      "chapters": [
        1046
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-and-chase",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan flees toward ancient cloud beasts, Tang Song is first to chase and urges the Eastern Sea immortals not to let him escape with the inheritance imprint. Distraction interrupts his killer move and he must start again. He later rides Zhou Li’s phantom waves with Liu Qing Yu to keep pressure on Fang Yuan, then hesitates when Fang Yuan threatens clan reprisal near the regional wall.",
      "chapters": [
        1047
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-and-chase",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_qing_yu"
      ]
    }
  ],
